    <bpmn:process id="W_W4994" name="W4994. Installer Matchmaking, Routing &amp; Lead Distribution" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Qualified request (W4993)
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: ~2–4 matches per request × ~3,000–6,000 requests/month
Owner: Pro-Referral Network Manager / Marketplace (VS-95) / IT
Participants: Marketplace (VS-95), IT (VS-27), Analytics (VS-28), Installer, CX (VS-13)
Source: workflow W4994 — Installer Matchmaking, Routing &amp; Lead Distribution</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4994_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4994_Lane1" name="Marketplace">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4994_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4994_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4994_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4994_Lane2" name="Network Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4994_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4994_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4994_Start4" name="Qualified request (W4993)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4994_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4994_Task5" name="Match the request to installers: by trade specialty, service area/location…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Match the request to installers: by trade specialty, service area/location (links VS-29), capacity/availability (W4999), tier (preferred-first W4989), rating (W5003), and pricing fit; produce a ranked shortlist
Responsible (R): Marketplace / IT / Analytics / Network Manager
Accountable (A): Network Manager
Duration: Per request</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4994_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4994_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4994_Task6" name="Distribute the lead: route the lead to the matched installer(s) per the routing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Distribute the lead: route the lead to the matched installer(s) per the routing model (preferred-first, rotation, or broadcast-auction), with the customer/project details (per consent W4993), and track acceptance/decline
Responsible (R): Marketplace / IT / Installer
Accountable (A): Network Manager
Duration: Per request</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4994_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4994_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4994_Task7" name="Manage routing rules &amp; fairness: tune the routing model for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage routing rules &amp; fairness: tune the routing model for fairness/anti-discrimination (links VS-129), monitor fill-rate and installer-load balance (W4999), and escalate unaccepted leads (W5000)
Responsible (R): Network Manager / Analytics / Legal
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4994_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4994_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4994_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4994_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4994_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-747 (ensure controlled execution — Pro-Referral Matchmaking, Project Routing &amp; Lead Management (PA-172.2).) | - CTL-747: match criteria accurate; routing fair; lead-acceptance tracked; unaccepted escalated (W5000)
Owner: Pro-Referral Network Manager / Marketplace (VS-95) / IT</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4994_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4994_Annotation9" targetRef="W4994_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4994_Flow11" sourceRef="W4994_Start4" targetRef="W4994_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4994_Flow12" sourceRef="W4994_Task5" targetRef="W4994_Task6" />
