    <bpmn:process id="W_W4995" name="W4995. Lead Handoff, Customer-Installer Communication &amp; Quote Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Lead accepted (W4994)
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: ~2–3 handoffs/quotes per accepted lead
Owner: Pro-Referral Network Manager / Installer / CX (VS-13)
Participants: Installer, CX (VS-13), Marketplace (VS-95), Sales Enablement (VS-124), Privacy (VS-91)
Source: workflow W4995 — Lead Handoff, Customer-Installer Communication &amp; Quote Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4995_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4995_Lane1" name="Marketplace">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4995_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4995_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4995_Lane2" name="Installer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4995_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4995_Lane3" name="CX">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4995_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4995_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4995_Start5" name="Lead accepted (W4994)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4995_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4995_Task6" name="Hand off &amp; connect: provide the installer the customer/project details (per…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Hand off &amp; connect: provide the installer the customer/project details (per consent W4993), connect customer↔installer (via platform-masked comms or direct per consent), and confirm the installer&#x27;s acknowledgement and site-visit/quote timing
Responsible (R): Marketplace / Installer / CX
Accountable (A): Network Manager
Duration: Per lead</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4995_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4995_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4995_Task7" name="Manage the quote: the installer provides a quote/proposal (scope, price…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Manage the quote: the installer provides a quote/proposal (scope, price, timeline, materials), the customer reviews/negotiates/accepts, and the platform captures the quote for transparency (links VS-12/VS-11 pricing)
Responsible (R): Installer / CX / Marketplace
Accountable (A): Installer
Duration: Per lead</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4995_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4995_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4995_Task8" name="Support &amp; govern: CX supports the customer through the quote, govern pricing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Support &amp; govern: CX supports the customer through the quote, govern pricing fairness (VS-129 anti-predatory), manage communication/complaints (VS-13), and capture consent/privacy on the ongoing exchange
Responsible (R): CX / Network Manager / DPO / Legal
Accountable (A): Network Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4995_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4995_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4995_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4995_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4995_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-747 (ensure controlled execution — Pro-Referral Matchmaking, Project Routing &amp; Lead Management (PA-172.2).) | - CTL-747: handoff confirmed; quote captured; pricing fair (VS-129); comms governed; privacy respected
Owner: Pro-Referral Network Manager / Installer / CX (VS-13)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4995_Assoc11" sourceRef="W4995_Annotation10" targetRef="W4995_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
